Conflicts: mlnx-driver, mlnx-ofed-kernel-dkms, mlnx-ofed-kernel-modules
Suggests: sockperf, infiniband-diags
Description: NAS RDMA diagnostics and benchmarks using distribution drivers
 Installs RDMA device inspection, connection tests, bandwidth and latency
 benchmarks alongside Ethernet, firmware and storage diagnostics.
 .
 Uses the RDMA libraries and providers from the TrueNAS distribution and
 the drivers built with its kernel. No vendor OFED or DOCA driver stack,
 firmware updater, automatic NIC tuning or storage service is installed
 or enabled by this package.
